Issue #1696 chat-container half, re-captured 2026-09-02T17:02:19Z after the
independent security review of PR #1712.

The patch is applied to the three backend files INSIDE the pinned image
(ghcr.io/open-webui/open-webui:v0.10.2@sha256:9fcea9c6...), which is where the
chat image takes its backend from. The function under test is then imported and
called for real; only Open WebUI's own OAuth session resolver and the two HTTP
endpoints are stood in for. The gateway listens on 127.0.0.1:9911 and the host
a hostile instance admin repointed at listens on 127.0.0.1:9912, which is a
different origin, since origin is what the check compares.

